DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1710509001","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"你再次展开维伦的信笺，确认寻找隐士的具体方法。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"document:1:502:0":{"key":"document:1:502:0","kind":"document","source_node_id":"1","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"致我亲爱的、总是身处漩涡中心的梅林大人：\n听说赛凡纳最近热闹得很？又是教堂消失，又是公主失踪的，甚至还有拔石中剑未果的戏码？虽然我此刻正身处几百里外享受美酒，但风中传来的消息简直比吟游诗人的剧本还要精彩。\n我猜，你现在一定又在为了收拾这些烂摊子而忙得焦头烂额吧？\n既然你卷进了这种大麻烦里，以你的性格，肯定正四处寻找那些隐在暗处的情报。\n作为你的骑士，我必须给你一个严肃的——尽管我知道你肯定听不进去的——忠告：离隐士远一点。\n虽然隐士只是个民间组织，不杀人也不放火，但跟隐士里的这帮家伙打交道……很累。\n他们不缺金币，也不收人情。唯一的嗜好，就是窥探秘密。\n想从他们嘴里套出话来，你就得拿自己核心的秘密去换。相信我，那种被刨根问底、仿佛没穿衣服一样被审视的感觉，绝对比跟人打架还要让人不爽。\n……不过，以你的性格，为了真相恐怕在所不惜吧？\n真拿你没办法。如果你非要去，那就给你指条明路（真的是明路吗？）——\n去城郊的<style=\"highlight\">维纳尔墓园</style>。\n<style=\"highlight\">找到一个特殊的棺材，别犹豫，躺进去</style>。\n别担心，那只是特殊的待客之道。虽然那里面有点挤，空气也不太新鲜，但你就当是提前体验一下人生的“终点”好了——毕竟在赛凡纳，这种安静的地方可不多见。\n祝你好运，大魔法师。希望你从棺材里爬出来的时候，身上的秘密还能剩下几件。\n你最忠实的骑士\n维伦","textdes_id":"502","document_page_count":"1","document_title_cn":"维伦的信","document_order":"1","document_object_id":"1500578","document_item_id":"0","document_icon":"UI/Icon/Item/item_quest_mapstory_item4.png","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"UI/Prefabs/StoryReadItem/items/pbui_map_story_detail_item4.prefab","document_pic":"","document_gender":"false"},"say:2:1710509002:0":{"key":"say:2:1710509002:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"2","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1710509002","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"——前往城郊的维纳尔墓园，<style=highlig...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:3:1710509003:0":{"key":"say:3:1710509003:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"3","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1710509003","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"你的目光扫过一排排墓碑，最终落在墓园的最深处——","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:4:1710509004:0":{"key":"say:4:1710509004:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"4","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1710509004","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"那里有一段向上延伸的石阶，阶梯的尽头似乎有一具棺材。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:5:1710509005:0":{"key":"say:5:1710509005:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"5","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1710509005","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"旁边甚至有一些光亮，仿佛在无声地邀请着什么。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""}},"speaker_entries":{"speaker:旁白":{"key":"speaker:旁白","source":"旁白"}},"stats":{"source_node_count":7,"graph_node_count":7,"effect_event_count":0,"text_entry_count":6,"speaker_entry_count":1,"cast_state_line_count":5,"path_dependent_cast_state_count":0,"cinematic_count":0,"picture_count":0,"subtitle_count":0,"cinematic_dialogue_count":0}}